  {
   "text": "Two Zendikar Rising Commander decks are released together with Zendikar Rising . These are meant to be on-ramps to Commander , with a few new cards (three per deck) and the rest reprints .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "There are six new cards (with printed set code ZNC and collector numbers #001–006) printed in the Zendikar Rising Commander Decks. Two are mythic rare and the other four are rare . These cards are legal for play in the Commander , Vintage , and Legacy formats. They aren't legal for play in the Standard , Pioneer , or Modern formats. The other cards in these decks (with printed set code ZNC and collector numbers 007–142) are legal for play in any format that already allows those cards; that is, appearing in these decks doesn't change a card's legality in any format.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like with Ikoria Commander , the new cards are themed to the world and the reprints can be from anywhere.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each package contains:",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "Note that the new packaging doesn't contain the oversized foil commander card that was part of previous products in the Commander series .",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
